:"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-02T01:19:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T10:14:31Z","closed_at":"2025-06-02T10:11:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nPresent in all of Godot 4.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - 4.5 Dev 4\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using an Enum in gdscript, the auto-complete for the enum values doesn't show up with match statement, at least no consistently. Given the following code:\n`\nenum state {IDLE, WALK, RUN}\n\nfunc whatever(my_state: state):\n        if my_state == state.WALK:\n               do_stuff()\n\nfunc lorem(my_state: state):\n       match my_state:\n              state.WALK:\n                    do_some_more()\n`\nWhen typing out the if statement, WALK along with RUN and IDLE will show up in the auto completion. However, when typing the match statement, no such auto complete/hints show up. Stranger more, finishing typing out the match statement and then going back to the pattern, deleting WALK, only then will WALK, RUN, IDLE show up in the auto-complete.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ae90245-31b7-4bc3-bb0b-5a4998792350)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f6b3176-bc36-479a-afb1-d23ae3402c85)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15f567cf-a5da-46c5-894c-d1a8e46e6b14)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. make enum variable\n2. try out if vs match statements and auto complete\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107031/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}